SCRPRNT,.-.			/CHARACTER PRINT ROUTINE
	AND	[77]		/JUST SIX-BIT
	SNA			/END OF MESSAGE?
	JMP I	SCRIBE		/YES, RETURN TO ORIGINAL CALLER
	DCA	SCRCHAR		/NO, SAVE FOR NOW
	TAD	SCRCHAR		/GET IT BACK
